    "name": "AT&T Device Management API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "A messaging API enabling applications to send, receive, update, and delete MMS and SMS messages on behalf of AT&T users with explicit OAuth consent. Supports messages to phone numbers, short codes, and email addresses across AT&T and other carriers with full inbox management and delta synchronization.",
